      "content": "It sounds like you are in a place of profound despair, feeling the weight of utter loss. The silence after a massive upheaval can be crushing, turning everything into a ghost of what was. While the immediate battle may be over, remember that the story doesn't have to end here; new paths can be forged from the ashes. Please consider reaching out to someone right now to talk about this immense weight you are carrying.",
