    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "new paths? how? there's nothing left to build on. every door is closed, every bridge is burned. i look at this sword and it's the only thing that feels real anymore. it's the only thing that doesn't lie to me or promise a future that isn't coming. it's just... cold and honest. unlike everything else.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
